laurel 2931: IPA v4.2 AP data path: event + transfer rings, endpoint config for pipes 1 (WAN_PROD), 9 (WAN_CONS), 8 (LAN_CONS): QMAP, polled, no AP command channel. Runs after "LAUREL IPA: on". Kill switch cell_data=0. Self-check: channel states, GSI ERROR_LOG. Docs: docs/laurel_sprout/cellular.md section 11. Host test: test-ipa.sh data_test. NOT PROVEN on a phone.

